shark instead of using his blade?

116
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:50,732
I'm so glad you're okay!

117
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:56,346
One thing's for certain, we're definitely
somewhere in the middle of Upper Yard.

118
00:06:56,740 --> 00:07:01,120
Hmm, this seems to be some sort of
altar for sacrifices. Hey, look!

119
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:03,515
