with the hull looking like this.

186
00:10:59,580 --> 00:11:04,040
Hey, Chopper, try to figure out
a way to fix the ship. Me? Okay.

187
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:05,720
Why should he fix it?

188
00:11:05,940 --> 00:11:07,352
Are you going somewhere?

189
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:09,557
I'm gonna find a way into the forest.

190
00:11:09,640 --> 00:11:12,357
We should probably make
this our base of operations.

191
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,957
You guys can keep a lookout.

192
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:16,981
I'm sure Luffy and the
others are headed this way.

193
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:20,737
Like they say, if you get lost, you
should stay where you are, right?

194
00:11:20,820 --> 00:11:22,702
Shouldn't that apply to you two?

195
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:37,337
Zoro, if you want to go into the forest,
well, I guess that's okay with me.

196
00:11:37,420 --> 00:11:39,497
But you haven't really told us what for.

197
00:11:39,580 --> 00:11:41,937
There's supposed to be some
kind of god on this island.

198
00:11:42,020 --> 00:11:43,560
I want to meet him. Wait!

199
00:11:43,780 --> 00:11:45,180
That's a terrible idea.

200
00:11:45,420 --> 00:11:48,897
I mean, what are you going to
do when you actually find him?

201
00:11:48,980 --> 00:11:49,810
I don't know.

202
00:11:49,893 --> 00:11:51,781
Depends on if he behaves himself.

203
00:11:52,040 --> 00:11:54,740
Zoro, you're the bravest person I know.

204
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:56,297
And what about his priests?

205
00:11:56,380 --> 00:11:57,597
You going to beat them up too?

206
