Ah, excellent idea.

219
00:12:34,700 --> 00:12:36,524
Mind if I tag along, swordsman?

220
00:12:36,940 --> 00:12:40,717
Sure, as long as you promise not
to slow me down. Wait a minute!

221
00:12:40,800 --> 00:12:42,682
