222
00:12:42,940 --> 00:12:44,020
Look at this.

223
00:12:45,300 --> 00:12:49,124
At least a thousand years have
passed since this altar was built.

224
00:12:49,300 --> 00:12:50,660
A thousand years?

225
00:12:51,160 --> 00:12:53,336
The sense of history here is amazing.

226
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:54,960
It gives me chills.

227
00:12:55,340 --> 00:12:56,420
You feel it?

228
