236
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:35,760
He's lost his mind.

237
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:46,800
She made it!

238
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:49,240
Looks easy enough.

239
00:13:53,620 --> 00:13:56,820
This is higher up than
I thought. Be careful.

240
00:13:57,220 --> 00:13:59,514
If you fall, you'll most certainly die.

241
00:13:59,660 --> 00:14:02,189
That's supposed to be
your idea of helping?

242
00:14:05,940 --> 00:14:07,760
Whoa, she's right.

243
00:14:07,980 --> 00:14:09,300
I'm dead if I fall.

244
00:14:10,240 --> 00:14:11,070
Mommy?

245
00:14:18,020 --> 00:14:19,060
Help me!

246
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:21,100
It's too fast! I'm in a crash!

247
00:14:24,140 --> 00:14:25,100
Look at that.

248
00:14:25,220 --> 00:14:26,338
You're not gutless.

249
00:14:28,220 --> 00:14:29,980
Thanks for catching me.

250
00:14:30,920 --> 00:14:31,750
Anytime.

251
00:14:33,660 --> 00:14:35,097
That's what you should have done.

252
00:14:35,180 --> 00:14:37,004
That had nothing to do with it!

253
00:14:39,240 --> 00:14:41,711
This forest is even bigger than I thought.

254
00:14:44,180 --> 00:14:46,357
Okay, Chopper, you're
in charge of the ship!

255
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:47,337
We're counting on you.

256
00:14:47,420 --> 00:14:48,900
We'll be back soon!

257
00:14:49,440 --> 00:14:51,377
Bye, everyone be careful.

258
00:14:51,460 --> 00:14:53,440
Don't take too long, okay?

259
00:14:56,900 --> 00:15:00,488
I guess nami will be alright
since she's with robin and zoro.

260
00:15:00,680 --> 00:15:03,268
My friends are all so
